  public:
    static QString gridLabel( const QString &start, int offset, bool avoidRepeatingLetters = false );
%Docstring
Returns the label of the guide grid row or column at ``offset`` from the
first one, labeled ``start``. ``start`` is either a number (1, 20, ...)
or letters (A, AA, BA, ...), letters run as A..Z, AA..AZ, BA..ZZ, AAA,
... If ``avoidRepeatingLetters`` is set, letter labels made of a single
repeated letter (AA, BB, AAA, ...) are skipped.
